{"4177120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BLOOD MALL: PART II", "steam_appid": 4177120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/9c2e4a4712401bc5fa45547dc9c1dc27.webp?t=1764811475\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras_big/9c2e4a4712401bc5fa45547dc9c1dc27.webp?t=1764811475 width=1560 height=49 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/06210565e87e2853b64d2315237b69ed.poster.avif?t=1764811475\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/06210565e87e2853b64d2315237b69ed.webm?t=1764811475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/06210565e87e2853b64d2315237b69ed.mp4?t=1764811475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BLOOD MALL: PART II</i></strong> is a retro-style dinosaur horror game that picks up exactly where <i>BLOOD MALL</i> left off. As a fully fledged game, <i>BLOOD MALL: PART II</i> takes the player through five distinct chapters set in fresh locations, armed with badass new weapons, multiple unique and ferocious enemies, and an elevated story with a cast of groovy characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/4921a06fe6c94257a92871e4918e0b15.poster.avif?t=1764811475\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/4921a06fe6c94257a92871e4918e0b15.webm?t=1764811475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/4921a06fe6c94257a92871e4918e0b15.mp4?t=1764811475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking inspiration from Puppet Combo, Half Life and Robocop, <i>BLOOD MALL: PART II</i> leans into government conspiracy, science fiction and blockbuster action, whilst keeping the tension and horror front and centre. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/7cebf5099cad95bc93ee9a4f0b6da86e.avif?t=1764811475\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras_big/7cebf5099cad95bc93ee9a4f0b6da86e.webp?t=1764811475 width=1560 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/59cf795fda227ceb9bfdd2d833dda9f7.poster.avif?t=1764811475\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/59cf795fda227ceb9bfdd2d833dda9f7.webm?t=1764811475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/59cf795fda227ceb9bfdd2d833dda9f7.mp4?t=1764811475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature list:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person gameplay with FPS mechanics and environmental interaction. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set across 5 distinct chapters, experience an elevated, cinematic story with intense setpieces, entertaining voice-acted characters and an engaging mystery. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arsenal of weapons - expand your firepower with a break-action shotgun, armor-piercing service revolver and a unique, powerful secret weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types - Encounter multiple ferocious Hastovenator enemy types with different behaviours and abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevated retro visuals - experience PSX visuals with a special 80s edge and a vibrant yet gritty style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destruction - destroy objects in the environment to clear paths, solve puzzles, and overcome threats. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental hazards - Encounter hazards that can have various effects such as poison, freezing, slowness and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quicktime Events - Tension is elevated with life-or-death QTE interactions.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/9c2e4a4712401bc5fa45547dc9c1dc27.webp?t=1764811475\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras_big/9c2e4a4712401bc5fa45547dc9c1dc27.webp?t=1764811475 width=1560 height=49 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/06210565e87e2853b64d2315237b69ed.poster.avif?t=1764811475\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/06210565e87e2853b64d2315237b69ed.webm?t=1764811475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/06210565e87e2853b64d2315237b69ed.mp4?t=1764811475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BLOOD MALL: PART II</i></strong> is a retro-style dinosaur horror game that picks up exactly where <i>BLOOD MALL</i> left off. As a fully fledged game, <i>BLOOD MALL: PART II</i> takes the player through five distinct chapters set in fresh locations, armed with badass new weapons, multiple unique and ferocious enemies, and an elevated story with a cast of groovy characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/4921a06fe6c94257a92871e4918e0b15.poster.avif?t=1764811475\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/4921a06fe6c94257a92871e4918e0b15.webm?t=1764811475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/4921a06fe6c94257a92871e4918e0b15.mp4?t=1764811475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking inspiration from Puppet Combo, Half Life and Robocop, <i>BLOOD MALL: PART II</i> leans into government conspiracy, science fiction and blockbuster action, whilst keeping the tension and horror front and centre. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/extras/7cebf5099cad95bc93ee9a4f0b6da86e.avif?t=1764811475\" data-big-src=h