s such as poison, freezing, slowness and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quicktime Events - Tension is elevated with life-or-death QTE interactions.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "BLOOD MALL: PART II is a retro-style dinosaur horror game that picks up exactly where BLOOD MALL left off. Are you prepared to put an end to the Hastovenator Crisis, or have you bitten off more than you can chew?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/d43b346a6d05a9cefc148a39fcf006775078a3ba/header.jpg?t=1764811475", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/ade06046a95508d6356f5d802275ee3f61edbec2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764811475", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177120/ade06046a95508d6356f5d802275ee3f61edbec2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764811475", "website": "https://www.reddit.com/r/bloodmall", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft® Windows® XP / Vista / 7 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.0 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Compatible with DirectX 8.1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Ollie Hall"], "publishers": ["DOSMan Publishing"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/